SUMMARY:Circle K Double Visits Rewards Day
LOCATION:All Locations Tampa \, FL 33601 United States
DESCRIPTION:Circle K is launching its new loyalty program\, Inner Circle \
 , which rewards customers based on how often they visit rather than how mu
 ch they spend. To celebrate the launch\, today is Double Visit Day \, mean
 ing customers who make a purchase in-store or fill up at the pump will ear
 n double visit credit toward their rewards. Points can be redeemed for: Up
  to 1 off per gallon of gas A free Polar Pop or snack after five visits A 
 free coffee or Monster Energy drink after 10 visits Additionally\, new Inn
 er Circle members will receive 25 cents off per gallon of gas on their fir
 st five fill-ups . \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/194386
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/194386
END:VEVENT
