SUMMARY:Free Class: Nutrition and Cancer Prevention
LOCATION:4620 N. 22nd St. Tampa 33610 Tampa \, FL 33610 United States
DESCRIPTION:Overview: Join us for a community program about how healthy ha
 bits such as nutrition\, health screenings\, and other lifestyle factors m
 ay help reduce cancer risk. This class will be taught by Kayla Jones-Willi
 s with Moffitt Cancer Center. Registration: This is a free class. TFHC wil
 l provide the materials\, but registration is required. Space is limited t
 o 40 participants. Event Location: The class begins at 9:30 AM. We will me
 et in the employee breakroom at the Osborne center. 4620 N. 22nd St. Tampa
  FL 33611. You will receive an email with location details prior to the ev
 ent. Please contact Nicole Pinson\, Garden Manager\, if you need more info
 rmation or assistance: npinsonhcnetwork.org or 813-459-3831. We have a wat
 er cooler\, so please bring a beverage or your refillable water bottle. \n
