SUMMARY:Lung Cancer Survivors: Fight Infections During the Holidays!
LOCATION:3751 E Fowler Ave Tampa \, FL 33901 United States
DESCRIPTION:NOTE: Registration Required Come and enjoy a wonderful\, free 
 lunch and hear Jenna Kay Rivers\, Infection Preventionist  MPH\, CPH\, CIC
 \, present Fight Infections During the Holidays. Rivers is a certified Inf
 ection Preventionist at Moffitt Cancer Center\, and attendees will learn h
 ow they can avoid infections and illnesses over the upcoming busy holiday 
 season\, ensuring they stay healthy and happy while spending time with the
 ir loved ones. As Jenna says\, In oncology\, infection prevention isnt the
 oretical\\\; its personal. Our patients dont have the immune reserve to ab
 sorb system gaps. Every prevention strategy we implement is ultimately abo
 ut protecting someone whose body is already fighting hard enough . Jenna b
 egan her career at Moffitt in 2013 and advanced into infection prevention 
 through continued education and professional growth. She earned her MPH wi
 th dual concentrations in Epidemiology and Global Communicable Disease fro
 m the University of South Florida and holds certifications in Public Healt
 h (CPH) and Infection Control (CIC). LiveLungs educational meetings provid
 e valuable resources and opportunities for lung cancer patients\, survivor
 s\, and their care partners to learn\, network\, and build community . Eac
 h meeting features an expert guest speaker who shares insights to empower 
 attendees with knowledge and support. Lung cancer patients and their care 
 partners are welcome to learn more and register at https:www.livelung.orgm
 eetingstampa or call 877.311.LUNG (5864) . \n\nPermalink: https://www.tamp
 a.gov/node/193861
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/193861
END:VEVENT
