 dents will make a 18x24 tonal drawing from the live model and sketch the s
 culptures in the museums antiquities collection in order to learn core pri
 nciples. Each lesson focuses on using simple tools to communicate the acti
 on of the body clearly and effectively. Drawing materials provided. This c
