SUMMARY:The Art of Darioush Wine Dinner
LOCATION:1606 W Snow Ave Tampa \, FL 33606 United States
DESCRIPTION:Where old-world tradition meets modern Napa Valley artistry. F
 eaturing two exclusive winery releases. Experience an extraordinary evenin
 g exploring the artistry and evolution of Darioush through five distinctiv
 e wines\, thoughtfully paired with a multi-course dinner. At the heart of 
 the evening\, experience two vintages of Darioush Signature Cabernet Sauvi
 gnon side by side  2015 and 2022  offering a rare opportunity to discover 
 how time\, vintage and craftsmanship shape one of the winerys signature ex
 pressions. The 2015 vintage is an exclusive winery release\, making this c
 omparison one rarely experienced outside the Darioush estate. The journey 
 concludes with the exceptionally rare 2014 Shahpar Late Harvest\, another 
 winery-exclusive release and a distinctive finale to the evening. Cocktail
  reception begins at 6:30 PM\, followed by a multi-course dinner at 7:00 P
 M. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/194346
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/194346
