SUMMARY:The United Photographic Artists Gallery (UPAG) Opening Reception
LOCATION:1630 East 7th Avenue Tampa \, FL 33605 United States
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the Opening Reception of UPAG\, a group exhibition
 . The theme\, one most appropriate for the difficulties of the past couple
  of years\, is Resilience. It encompasses the challenges faced by all the 
 artists\, and their unstoppable desire to continue creating meaningful\, p
 ersonal expressions of their lives\, beliefs\, and environments. Resilienc
 e applies to the diverse genres and styles presented by the artists who ha
 ve\, and continue to\, endure many challenges in a complex and rapidly cha
 nging world. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/194701
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/194701
END:VEVENT
