DESCRIPTION:Take Date Night to New Depths Let us set the backdrop to an un
 forgettable evening. Come wander through immersive habitats\, linger benea
 th the glow of the exhibits\, and discover a more intimate side of The Flo
 rida Aquarium. Bring your favorite person and receive one FREE general adm
 ission with the purchase of one paid admission after 5 PM. With extended h
 ours until 8 PM\, you have plenty of time to explore\, connect\, and make 
 the night last just a little longer during this rare opportunity to explor
 e the Aquarium after dark. Every Friday\, August 28September 25 Offer Deta
 ils: Excludes Member Night\, Sept. 18. Available only at the Aquarium tick
 et window after 5 PM on the day of your visit. Buy one paid admission\, re
 ceive one free general admission. Offers cannot be combined with other dis
 counts or promotions. \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/194221
