SUMMARY:Laser Light Shows: Elton John Queen
LOCATION:4801 E Fowler Ave Tampa \, FL 33617-2017 United States
DESCRIPTION:Laser Light Shows are taking over the Holloway Digital Dome Th
 eatre (https:mosi.orgexperienceholloway-digital-dome-theatre)\, home to th
 e Saunders Planetarium (https:mosi.orgexperiencesaunders-planetarium). Ste
 p inside Americas second-largest planetarium and experience vivid laser vi
 suals\, dynamic music\, and dazzling special effects. Designed for all age
 s\, our Laser Light Shows have something for everyone. Each performance pa
 irs stunning visuals with your favorite soundtracks. You wont just watch t
 he show\, youll feel like youre part of it. Before the lasers hit the dome
 \, our astronomer will guide you through a live star show\, taking you on 
 a journey into the night sky. Dont miss this exciting mix of science\, mus
 ic\, and light at MOSI! Whether youre a first-timer or a longtime fan\, yo
 ull be amazed. Tickets are limited\, snag yours today before they sell out
 ! \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/193736
